    <string name="section_experimental">Experimental</string>
    <string name="settings_experimental_intro">To get around Kindle\'s share and copy limits: it forbids selecting a long passage in the reading view, so sharing one and copying one both fail. The notebook screen puts each highlight in the accessibility tree as plain text, so reading it works — no selection, no clipboard.</string>
    <string name="settings_experimental_warning">Experimental: the heuristics read screen structure, so a Kindle redesign may break them. That is why anything collected is shown for review before it is written.</string>
