    <string name="settings_start_collect">Start collecting</string>
    <string name="settings_collector_not_running">System settings show it as enabled, but the service is not actually running (seen on Xiaomi). Toggling that switch off and back on fixes it.</string>
    <string name="settings_open_accessibility">Re-enable it in accessibility settings</string>
    <string name="settings_collector_off">The service is not on yet. Settings → Accessibility → "Downloaded services" → find "Collect highlights from Kindle\'s notebook screen" → turn it on and tap Allow in the dialog. Note this is not the "Accessibility shortcut" toggle at the top of that page, which is for a shortcut button.</string>
